<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Centennial Coal bids for AQC.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Centennial Coal bids for AQC.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial Coal Co Ltd said on Thursday it intended to make a cash offer for all the shares in Allied Queensland Coalfields that it does not already own at 60 cents per share.</p>
<p>Centennial is presently entitled to 9.99 percent of Allied Queensland Coalfields (AQC).</p>
<p>The bid values AQC at A$16.6 million.</p>
</text>
